# Eitr machine-local bar screen preference: the owner's machine.
#
# Install as ~/.config/hypr/preferred-outputs (ignored by Git). Each line names
# a Hyprland output; the bar uses the first connected one until a primary
# display is chosen in the Display panel. Without this file the bar defaults to
# the largest active display. Blank lines and text after # are ignored.
HDMI-A-1
DP-3
